### ─────────────────────────────────────────
###  AUTH  (/api/auth)
### ─────────────────────────────────────────

### Sign Up – Admin (Location Admin)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Jonathan",
    "surname": "Johnson",
    "userType": "Admin",
    "adminType": "Location Admin",
    "email": "jonathan@uowl.com",
    "password": "pswrd"
}

###

### Sign Up – Admin (Super Admin)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Khaled",
    "surname": "Abou Hechmeh",
    "userType": "Admin",
    "adminType": "Super Admin",
    "email": "khaled@uowl.com",
    "password": "pswrd"
}

### Sign Up – Client
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Jane",
    "surname": "Janeson",
    "userType": "Client",
    "email": "jane@outlook.com",
    "password": "pswrd"
}

### Sign In - Admin
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/signin
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "userType": "Admin",
    "email": "jonathan@uowl.com",
    "password": "pswrd"
}

### Sign In - Client
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/signin
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "userType": "Client",
    "email": "jane@outlook.com",
    "password": "pswrd"
}

### Sign Out
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/signout

### Who Am I
GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth/whoami


### ─────────────────────────────────────────
###  USERS  (/api/users)   [AuthGuard required]
### ─────────────────────────────────────────

### Get All Users  [SuperAdminGuard]
GET http://localhost:3000/api/users

### Get User By Id  [AdminGuard + SuperAdminGuard]
GET http://localhost:3000/api/users/2

### Update User
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Khaled",
    "surname": "Abou Hechmeh",
    "email": "admin1@outlook.com",
    "password": "pswrd"
}

### Change User Password
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/users/2/changePassword/password123

### Assign Location to Location Admin  [SuperAdminGuard]
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/users/assign-location/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "locationId": 1
}

### Unassign Location from Location Admin  [SuperAdminGuard]
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/users/unassign-location/3

### Delete User By Id
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/users/1
